{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Craft the Perfect Feed for Your Horses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/5d98818883c22806d71f5adfa750eed6.poster.avif?t=1771687415\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/5d98818883c22806d71f5adfa750eed6.webm?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/5d98818883c22806d71f5adfa750eed6.mp4?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut grass, plant crops on your farmland, and discover or invent advanced horse feed recipes to craft the perfect feed for your horses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Care for Your Horses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/2e62de55947eba314564984f9f0a3f2f.poster.avif?t=1771687415\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/2e62de55947eba314564984f9f0a3f2f.webm?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/2e62de55947eba314564984f9f0a3f2f.mp4?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your horses and perform daily tasks to keep them comfortable, healthy, and in top condition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Train Your Horses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/00926d936bd26ccf62d0c2a9ef8afb46.poster.avif?t=1771687415\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/00926d936bd26ccf62d0c2a9ef8afb46.webm?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/00926d936bd26ccf62d0c2a9ef8afb46.mp4?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of training approaches to improve different aspects of your horses and make them stand out in the market.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. Breed Elite Bloodlines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/515eb3e168bdbbb9f9c76f3f1e8bd5eb.poster.avif?t=1771687415\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/515eb3e168bdbbb9f9c76f3f1e8bd5eb.webm?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/515eb3e168bdbbb9f9c76f3f1e8bd5eb.mp4?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed foals across generations to improve growth and inherit powerful, positive traits. Discover, inherit, and combine epic horse bloodlines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5. Establish Your Own Merchant Caravan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/f944f7191bcba74326e1393463ac258f.poster.avif?t=1771687415\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/f944f7191bcba74326e1393463ac258f.webm?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/f944f7191bcba74326e1393463ac258f.mp4?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare wagons, hire merchants, and equip them with horses to open trade routes between towns and earn high profits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6. Run Your Own Blacksmith Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/93a74ccf3bb90cfb30dbacff17452603.poster.avif?t=1771687415\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/93a74ccf3bb90cfb30dbacff17452603.webm?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/93a74ccf3bb90cfb30dbacff17452603.mp4?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine ores, build your own blacksmith shop, upgrade equipment, uncover legendary blueprints, and craft high-quality items for your horses and mercenaries, or sell them to customers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>7. Build Your Own Mercenary Army</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/6bc7f16aa9e6cddeb70a8348cc7fe6f5.poster.avif?t=1771687415\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/6bc7f16aa9e6cddeb70a8348cc7fe6f5.webm?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/6bc7f16aa9e6cddeb70a8348cc7fe6f5.mp4?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire villagers and train them into different troop types. Prepare weapons, armor, and horses, develop them from rookies into elite veterans, and accept contracts from nearby rulers and other clients.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>8. Raise Livestock</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/bdb8dd0688e4c328803af29d78a1d8db.poster.avif?t=1771687415\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/bdb8dd0688e4c328803af29d78a1d8db.webm?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/bdb8dd0688e4c328803af29d78a1d8db.mp4?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise livestock, build shelters, and collect products such as milk and eggs. Care for newborn animals and sell livestock to local farmers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>9. Craft Valuable Goods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/56bdde256fec1064cefbc6454f976438.poster.avif?t=1771687415\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/56bdde256fec1064cefbc6454f976438.webm?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503710/extras/56bdde256fec1064cefbc6454f976438.mp4?t=1771687415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce cheese, brew beer, and craft other valuable goods to expand your business.</p